OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start this morning
OL,6,Facross the south, otherwise a rather
OL,7,Fcloudy day with outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fspreading southwards. The rain
OL,9,Fheaviest and most persistent across
OL,10,Fhills in the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain gradually easing this
OL,13,Fevening and clearing to the south by
OL,14,Fmidnight. Overnight will then remain
OL,15,Fdry with clear spells and a few mist
OL,16,Fpatches developing. Feeling fresher.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FMist patches quickly clearing
OL,19,Fto leave a dry and sunny day. Feeling
OL,20,Fpleasantly warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
